{"id":"ed2ee4e2a09a5fbf","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/090_选择函数演算_Choice-function_Calculus.md","title":"090 选择函数演算 Choice-function Calculus","display":"090_选择函数演算_Choice-function_Calculus","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n\n<h1 id=\"1.-选择签名\">1. 选择签名</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=(Fun,Rel,ar_F,ar_R)\">\\(\\Sigma=(Fun,Rel,ar_F,ar_R)\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Fun\\cap Rel=\\varnothing\">\\(Fun\\cap Rel=\\varnothing\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_F:Fun\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(ar_F:Fun\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_R:Rel\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(ar_R:Rel\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>。选择符号集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Choice=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Choice=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。变量集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"var,\\quad fun,\\quad choose,\\quad rel,\\quad eq,\\quad neg,\\quad imp,\\quad all.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[var,\\quad fun,\\quad choose,\\quad rel,\\quad eq,\\quad neg,\\quad imp,\\quad all.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)=\\{X\\in\\mathcal P(Var):\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to Var\\ X=\\{e(i):i&lt;n\\}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)=\\{X\\in\\mathcal P(Var):\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to Var\\ X=\\{e(i):i&lt;n\\}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>新变量函数为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"fresh:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\\to Var,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[fresh:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\\to Var,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>并满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"fresh(X)=v_m\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nm=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[fresh(X)=v_m\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nm=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"2.-项与公式\">2. 项与公式</h1>\n<p>项集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Tm_C\">\\(Tm_C\\)</span> 与公式集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Frm_C\">\\(Frm_C\\)</span> 同时定义为满足下列闭包条件的最小二元组：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"var(x)\\in Tm_C\">\\(var(x)\\in Tm_C\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in Fun\">\\(f\\in Fun\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_F(f)=n\">\\(ar_F(f)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to Tm_C\">\\(\\tau:n\\to Tm_C\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"fun(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_C\">\\(fun(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_C\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in Choice\">\\(c\\in Choice\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_C\">\\(A\\in Frm_C\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"choose(c,x,A)\\in Tm_C\">\\(choose(c,x,A)\\in Tm_C\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\in Rel\">\\(R\\in Rel\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ar_R(R)=n\">\\(ar_R(R)=n\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau:n\\to Tm_C\">\\(\\tau:n\\to Tm_C\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"rel(R,\\tau)\\in Frm_C\">\\(rel(R,\\tau)\\in Frm_C\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,t\\in Tm_C\">\\(s,t\\in Tm_C\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"eq(s,t)\\in Frm_C\">\\(eq(s,t)\\in Frm_C\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_C\">\\(A\\in Frm_C\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"neg(A)\\in Frm_C\">\\(neg(A)\\in Frm_C\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_C\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_C\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"imp(A,B)\\in Frm_C\">\\(imp(A,B)\\in Frm_C\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in Frm_C\">\\(A\\in Frm_C\\)</span> 蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"all(x,A)\\in Frm_C\">\\(all(x,A)\\in Frm_C\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<h1 id=\"3.-自由变量\">3. 自由变量</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T^C:Tm_C\\to\\mathcal P(Var),\n\\qquad\nFV_F^C:Frm_C\\to\\mathcal P(Var).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T^C:Tm_C\\to\\mathcal P(Var),\n\\qquad\nFV_F^C:Frm_C\\to\\mathcal P(Var).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>本文件中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_T\">\\(FV_T\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_T^C\">\\(FV_T^C\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_F\">\\(FV_F\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"FV_F^C\">\\(FV_F^C\\)</span>。自由变量函数满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(var(x))=\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(fun(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_F(f)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(fun(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_F(f)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_T(choose(c,x,A))=FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_T(choose(c,x,A))=FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(rel(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_R(R)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(rel(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_R(R)}FV_T(\\tau(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(eq(s,t))=FV_T(s)\\cup FV_T(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(neg(A))=FV_F(A),\n\\quad\nFV_F(imp(A,B))=FV_F(A)\\cup FV_F(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(neg(A))=FV_F(A),\n\\quad\nFV_F(imp(A,B))=FV_F(A)\\cup FV_F(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"FV_F(all(x,A))=FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[FV_F(all(x,A))=FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义绑定变量函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_T^C:Tm_C\\to\\mathcal P(Var),\n\\qquad\nBV_F^C:Frm_C\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_T^C:Tm_C\\to\\mathcal P(Var),\n\\qquad\nBV_F^C:Frm_C\\to\\mathcal P(Var)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_T^C(var(x))=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_T^C(var(x))=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_T^C(fun(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_F(f)}BV_T^C(\\tau(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_T^C(fun(f,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_F(f)}BV_T^C(\\tau(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_T^C(choose(c,x,A))=BV_F^C(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_T^C(choose(c,x,A))=BV_F^C(A)\\cup\\{x\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^C(rel(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_R(R)}BV_T^C(\\tau(i)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^C(rel(R,\\tau))=\\bigcup_{i&lt;ar_R(R)}BV_T^C(\\tau(i)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^C(eq(s,t))=BV_T^C(s)\\cup BV_T^C(t),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^C(eq(s,t))=BV_T^C(s)\\cup BV_T^C(t),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^C(neg(A))=BV_F^C(A),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^C(neg(A))=BV_F^C(A),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^C(imp(A,B))=BV_F^C(A)\\cup BV_F^C(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^C(imp(A,B))=BV_F^C(A)\\cup BV_F^C(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"BV_F^C(all(x,A))=BV_F^C(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[BV_F^C(all(x,A))=BV_F^C(A)\\cup\\{x\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"4.-替换与-alpha-等价\">4. 替换与 alpha 等价</h1>\n<p>定义替换函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_T^C:Tm_C\\times Var\\times Tm_C\\to Tm_C,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_T^C:Tm_C\\times Var\\times Tm_C\\to Tm_C,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Sub_F^C:Frm_C\\times Var\\times Tm_C\\to Frm_C.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Sub_F^C:Frm_C\\times Var\\times Tm_C\\to Frm_C.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"t[x:=s]\">\\(t[x:=s]\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sub_T^C(t,x,s)\">\\(Sub_T^C(t,x,s)\\)</span>，记号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A[x:=s]\">\\(A[x:=s]\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Sub_F^C(A,x,s)\">\\(Sub_F^C(A,x,s)\\)</span>。替换满足</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"var(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nvar(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[var(y)[x:=s]=\n\\begin{cases}\ns,&amp;y=x,\\\\\nvar(y),&amp;y\\ne x,\n\\end{cases}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"fun(f,\\tau)[x:=s]=fun(f,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[fun(f,\\tau)[x:=s]=fun(f,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"rel(R,\\tau)[x:=s]=rel(R,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[rel(R,\\tau)[x:=s]=rel(R,i\\mapsto\\tau(i)[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"eq(t,u)[x:=s]=eq(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[eq(t,u)[x:=s]=eq(t[x:=s],u[x:=s]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"neg(A)[x:=s]=neg(A[x:=s]),\n\\quad\nimp(A,B)[x:=s]=imp(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[neg(A)[x:=s]=neg(A[x:=s]),\n\\quad\nimp(A,B)[x:=s]=imp(A[x:=s],B[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"choose(c,y,A)\">\\(choose(c,y,A)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"choose(c,y,A)[x:=s]=choose(c,y,A)\n\\quad(y=x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[choose(c,y,A)[x:=s]=choose(c,y,A)\n\\quad(y=x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"choose(c,y,A)[x:=s]=choose(c,y,A[x:=s])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin FV_T(s)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[choose(c,y,A)[x:=s]=choose(c,y,A[x:=s])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin FV_T(s)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x\">\\(y\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in FV_T(s)\">\\(y\\in FV_T(s)\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=fresh(FV_F(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=fresh(FV_F(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"choose(c,y,A)[x:=s]\n=\nchoose(c,z,(A[y:=var(z)])[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[choose(c,y,A)[x:=s]\n=\nchoose(c,z,(A[y:=var(z)])[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"all(y,A)\">\\(all(y,A)\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"all(y,A)[x:=s]=all(y,A)\n\\quad(y=x),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[all(y,A)[x:=s]=all(y,A)\n\\quad(y=x),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"all(y,A)[x:=s]=all(y,A[x:=s])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin FV_T(s)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[all(y,A)[x:=s]=all(y,A[x:=s])\n\\quad(y\\ne x\\land y\\notin FV_T(s)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\ne x\">\\(y\\ne x\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in FV_T(s)\">\\(y\\in FV_T(s)\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"z=fresh(FV_F(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[z=fresh(FV_F(A)\\cup FV_T(s)\\cup\\{x,y\\}),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>则</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"all(y,A)[x:=s]\n=\nall(z,(A[y:=var(z)])[x:=s]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[all(y,A)[x:=s]\n=\nall(z,(A[y:=var(z)])[x:=s]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_\\alpha^C\\subseteq (Tm_C\\cup Frm_C)^2\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_\\alpha^C\\subseteq (Tm_C\\cup Frm_C)^2\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>为所有满足下列条件的关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 的交。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Tm_C\\cup Frm_C\">\\(Tm_C\\cup Frm_C\\)</span> 上的等价关系，并满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall f\\in Fun\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\\n\\bigl(ar_F(f)=n\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\ ((\\tau(i),\\rho(i))\\in E)\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(fun(f,\\tau),fun(f,\\rho)\\bigr)\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall f\\in Fun\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\\n\\bigl(ar_F(f)=n\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\ ((\\tau(i),\\rho(i))\\in E)\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(fun(f,\\tau),fun(f,\\rho)\\bigr)\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall R\\in Rel\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\\n\\bigl(ar_R(R)=n\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\ ((\\tau(i),\\rho(i))\\in E)\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(rel(R,\\tau),rel(R,\\rho)\\bigr)\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall R\\in Rel\\ \\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\\n\\bigl(ar_R(R)=n\\land\\forall i&lt;n\\ ((\\tau(i),\\rho(i))\\in E)\\bigr)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(rel(R,\\tau),rel(R,\\rho)\\bigr)\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((s_0,t_0)\\in E\\land(s_1,t_1)\\in E)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(eq(s_0,s_1),eq(t_0,t_1)\\bigr)\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((s_0,t_0)\\in E\\land(s_1,t_1)\\in E)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(eq(s_0,s_1),eq(t_0,t_1)\\bigr)\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(neg(A),neg(B)\\bigr)\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,B)\\in E\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(neg(A),neg(B)\\bigr)\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"((A_0,B_0)\\in E\\land(A_1,B_1)\\in E)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(imp(A_0,A_1),imp(B_0,B_1)\\bigr)\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[((A_0,B_0)\\in E\\land(A_1,B_1)\\in E)\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(imp(A_0,A_1),imp(B_0,B_1)\\bigr)\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(choose(c,x,A),choose(c,x,B)\\bigr)\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,B)\\in E\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(choose(c,x,A),choose(c,x,B)\\bigr)\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"(A,B)\\in E\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(all(x,A),all(x,B)\\bigr)\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[(A,B)\\in E\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(all(x,A),all(x,B)\\bigr)\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y\\notin FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(choose(c,x,A),choose(c,y,A[x:=var(y)])\\bigr)\\in E,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y\\notin FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(choose(c,x,A),choose(c,y,A[x:=var(y)])\\bigr)\\in E,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"y\\notin FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(all(x,A),all(y,A[x:=var(y)])\\bigr)\\in E.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[y\\notin FV_F(A)\\setminus\\{x\\}\n\\Rightarrow\n\\bigl(all(x,A),all(y,A[x:=var(y)])\\bigr)\\in E.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-选择项相等谓词\">5. 选择项相等谓词</h1>\n<p>选择项谓词定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"ChTerm_C\\subseteq Tm_C,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[ChTerm_C\\subseteq Tm_C,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"ChTerm_C(u)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[ChTerm_C(u)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists c\\in Choice\\ \\exists x\\in Var\\ \\exists A\\in Frm_C\\\nu=choose(c,x,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists c\\in Choice\\ \\exists x\\in Var\\ \\exists A\\in Frm_C\\\nu=choose(c,x,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>选择项同域关系定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"SameDom_C\\subseteq Tm_C\\times Tm_C,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[SameDom_C\\subseteq Tm_C\\times Tm_C,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>且</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"SameDom_C(u,v)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[SameDom_C(u,v)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in Choice\">\\(c\\in Choice\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y,z\\in Var\">\\(x,y,z\\in Var\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in Frm_C\">\\(A,B\\in Frm_C\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u=choose(c,x,A)\n\\land\nv=choose(c,y,B)\n\\land\nA[x:=var(z)]\\equiv_\\alpha^C B[y:=var(z)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u=choose(c,x,A)\n\\land\nv=choose(c,y,B)\n\\land\nA[x:=var(z)]\\equiv_\\alpha^C B[y:=var(z)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>选择函数外延等式集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{ChExt}\n=\n\\{imp(all(z,imp(A[x:=var(z)],B[y:=var(z)])),\nimp(all(z,imp(B[y:=var(z)],A[x:=var(z)])),\neq(choose(c,x,A),choose(c,y,B)))):c\\in Choice,\\ x,y,z\\in Var,\\ A,B\\in Frm_C,\\ z\\notin FV_F(A)\\cup FV_F(B)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{ChExt}\n=\n\\{imp(all(z,imp(A[x:=var(z)],B[y:=var(z)])),\nimp(all(z,imp(B[y:=var(z)],A[x:=var(z)])),\neq(choose(c,x,A),choose(c,y,B)))):c\\in Choice,\\ x,y,z\\in Var,\\ A,B\\in Frm_C,\\ z\\notin FV_F(A)\\cup FV_F(B)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-逻辑、等词与选择公理\">6. 逻辑、等词与选择公理</h1>\n<p>逻辑等词公理集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_{base}^C\">\\(Ax_{base}^C\\)</span> 是下列集合的并：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to1}^{C}=\\{imp(A,imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_C\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\to1}^{C}=\\{imp(A,imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_C\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to2}^{C}=\\{imp(imp(A,imp(B,D)),imp(imp(A,B),imp(A,D))):A,B,D\\in Frm_C\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\to2}^{C}=\\{imp(imp(A,imp(B,D)),imp(imp(A,B),imp(A,D))):A,B,D\\in Frm_C\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\to3}^{C}=\\{imp(imp(neg(A),neg(B)),imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_C\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\to3}^{C}=\\{imp(imp(neg(A),neg(B)),imp(B,A)):A,B\\in Frm_C\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\forall1}^{C}=\\{imp(all(x,A),A[x:=t]):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_C,t\\in Tm_C\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\forall1}^{C}=\\{imp(all(x,A),A[x:=t]):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_C,t\\in Tm_C\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{\\forall2}^{C}=\\{imp(all(x,imp(A,B)),imp(A,all(x,B))):x\\in Var,\\ A,B\\in Frm_C,\\ x\\notin FV_F(A)\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{\\forall2}^{C}=\\{imp(all(x,imp(A,B)),imp(A,all(x,B))):x\\in Var,\\ A,B\\in Frm_C,\\ x\\notin FV_F(A)\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{=1}^{C}=\\{eq(t,t):t\\in Tm_C\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{=1}^{C}=\\{eq(t,t):t\\in Tm_C\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{=2}^{C}=\\{imp(eq(t,u),imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=u])):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_C,t,u\\in Tm_C\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{=2}^{C}=\\{imp(eq(t,u),imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=u])):x\\in Var,A\\in Frm_C,t,u\\in Tm_C\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{base}^C\n=\nAx_{\\to1}^{C}\n\\cup Ax_{\\to2}^{C}\n\\cup Ax_{\\to3}^{C}\n\\cup Ax_{\\forall1}^{C}\n\\cup Ax_{\\forall2}^{C}\n\\cup Ax_{=1}^{C}\n\\cup Ax_{=2}^{C}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{base}^C\n=\nAx_{\\to1}^{C}\n\\cup Ax_{\\to2}^{C}\n\\cup Ax_{\\to3}^{C}\n\\cup Ax_{\\forall1}^{C}\n\\cup Ax_{\\forall2}^{C}\n\\cup Ax_{=1}^{C}\n\\cup Ax_{=2}^{C}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>选择见证公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{ChWit}\n=\n\\{imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=choose(c,x,A)]):c\\in Choice,x\\in Var,t\\in Tm_C,A\\in Frm_C\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{ChWit}\n=\n\\{imp(A[x:=t],A[x:=choose(c,x,A)]):c\\in Choice,x\\in Var,t\\in Tm_C,A\\in Frm_C\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>选择一致公理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{ChEq}\n=\n\\{eq(u,v):u,v\\in Tm_C,\\ ChTerm_C(u),\\ ChTerm_C(v),\\ SameDom_C(u,v)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{ChEq}\n=\n\\{eq(u,v):u,v\\in Tm_C,\\ ChTerm_C(u),\\ ChTerm_C(v),\\ SameDom_C(u,v)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"SameDom_C\">\\(SameDom_C\\)</span> 的同符号条件，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Ax_{ChEq}\">\\(Ax_{ChEq}\\)</span> 中每个等式的两端必存在同一个\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\\in Choice\">\\(c\\in Choice\\)</span> 使其分别具有形状 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"choose(c,x,A)\">\\(choose(c,x,A)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"choose(c,y,B)\">\\(choose(c,y,B)\\)</span>；不同选择符号不会仅凭定义域同构而进入该公理族。</p>\n<p>全体公理为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Ax_{Choice}=Ax_{base}^C\\cup Ax_{ChWit}\\cup Ax_{ChExt}\\cup Ax_{ChEq}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Ax_{Choice}=Ax_{base}^C\\cup Ax_{ChWit}\\cup Ax_{ChExt}\\cup Ax_{ChEq}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"7.-规则关系\">7. 规则关系</h1>\n<p>规则关系为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\to^C=\\{((A,imp(A,B)),B):A,B\\in Frm_C\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\to^C=\\{((A,imp(A,B)),B):A,B\\in Frm_C\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\forall^C=\\{((A),all(x,A)):A\\in Frm_C,x\\in Var\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\forall^C=\\{((A),all(x,A)):A\\in Frm_C,x\\in Var\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Rule_\\alpha^C=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in Frm_C,A\\equiv_\\alpha^C B\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Rule_\\alpha^C=\\{((A),B):A,B\\in Frm_C,A\\equiv_\\alpha^C B\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-证明对象\">8. 证明对象</h1>\n<p>从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_C\">\\(\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_C\\)</span> 出发的选择函数证明是非空有限公式序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\">\\((A_0,\\ldots,A_{m-1})\\)</span>，每一行满足：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in\\Gamma\">\\(A_i\\in\\Gamma\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A_i\\in Ax_{Choice}\">\\(A_i\\in Ax_{Choice}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j,k&lt;i\">\\(j,k&lt;i\\)</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in Rule_\\to^C\">\\(((A_j,A_k),A_i)\\in Rule_\\to^C\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in Var\">\\(x\\in Var\\)</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in Rule_\\forall^C\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in Rule_\\forall^C\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}FV_F(B)\">\\(x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}FV_F(B)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j&lt;i\">\\(j&lt;i\\)</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"((A_j),A_i)\\in Rule_\\alpha^C\">\\(((A_j),A_i)\\in Rule_\\alpha^C\\)</span>。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>定义行许可谓词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LineOK}_{C}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\">\\(\\operatorname{LineOK}_{C}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i)\\)</span> 当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\pi(i)\\in\\Gamma\n\\vee\n\\pi(i)\\in Ax_{Choice}\n\\vee\n\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ (((\\pi(j),\\pi(k)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_\\to^C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\pi(i)\\in\\Gamma\n\\vee\n\\pi(i)\\in Ax_{Choice}\n\\vee\n\\exists j,k&lt;i\\ (((\\pi(j),\\pi(k)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_\\to^C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\vee\n\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists x\\in Var\\bigl(\\pi(i)=all(x,\\pi(j))\n\\land x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}FV_F(B)\\bigr)\n\\vee\n\\exists j&lt;i\\ (((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_\\alpha^C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\vee\n\\exists j&lt;i\\ \\exists x\\in Var\\bigl(\\pi(i)=all(x,\\pi(j))\n\\land x\\notin\\bigcup_{B\\in\\Gamma}FV_F(B)\\bigr)\n\\vee\n\\exists j&lt;i\\ (((\\pi(j)),\\pi(i))\\in Rule_\\alpha^C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{C}(\\Gamma,\\pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{C}(\\Gamma,\\pi)\\)</span> 当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(m\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，使得</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\\wedge \\pi:m\\to Frm_C\n\\wedge\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{C}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[m&gt;0\\wedge \\pi:m\\to Frm_C\n\\wedge\n\\forall i&lt;m\\ \\operatorname{LineOK}_{C}(\\Gamma,\\pi,i).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"9.-可证关系\">9. 可证关系</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Gamma\\vdash_C A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\vdash_C A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi,m\">\\(\\pi,m\\)</span> 使得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{C}(\\Gamma,\\pi)\">\\(\\operatorname{Proof}_{C}(\\Gamma,\\pi)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi:m\\to Frm_C\">\\(\\pi:m\\to Frm_C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m&gt;0\">\\(m&gt;0\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi(m-1)=A\">\\(\\pi(m-1)=A\\)</span>。定理集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Thm_C=\\{A\\in Frm_C:\\varnothing\\vdash_C A\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Thm_C=\\{A\\in Frm_C:\\varnothing\\vdash_C A\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"10.-目标差异条款\">10. 目标差异条款</h1>\n<p>目标特征数据定义为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Feature}_C\n=\n\\bigl(Choice,\\ ChTerm_C,\\ SameDom_C,\\ Ax_{ChWit},\\ Ax_{ChExt},\\ Ax_{ChEq}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Feature}_C\n=\n\\bigl(Choice,\\ ChTerm_C,\\ SameDom_C,\\ Ax_{ChWit},\\ Ax_{ChExt},\\ Ax_{ChEq}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该数据含外显选择符号集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Choice\">\\(Choice\\)</span>。定义目标差异谓词</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_C\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Feature}_C\n=\n\\bigl(Choice,ChTerm_C,SameDom_C,Ax_{ChWit},Ax_{ChExt},Ax_{ChEq}\\bigr)\n\\land\nAx_{ChWit}\\cup Ax_{ChExt}\\cup Ax_{ChEq}\\subseteq Ax_{Choice}\n\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_C\\,\\forall A\\in Frm_C\\quad\n\\Gamma\\vdash_C A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\,\\exists m&gt;0\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{C}(\\Gamma,\\pi)\n\\land\\pi:m\\to Frm_C\n\\land\\pi(m-1)=A\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Delta_C\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathsf{Feature}_C\n=\n\\bigl(Choice,ChTerm_C,SameDom_C,Ax_{ChWit},Ax_{ChExt},Ax_{ChEq}\\bigr)\n\\land\nAx_{ChWit}\\cup Ax_{ChExt}\\cup Ax_{ChEq}\\subseteq Ax_{Choice}\n\\land\n\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq Frm_C\\,\\forall A\\in Frm_C\\quad\n\\Gamma\\vdash_C A\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists\\pi\\,\\exists m&gt;0\\,\n\\bigl(\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{C}(\\Gamma,\\pi)\n\\land\\pi:m\\to Frm_C\n\\land\\pi(m-1)=A\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"11.-整个形式系统\">11. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>最终形式系统为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{ChoiceFunctionCalculus}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma,\nChoice,\nVar,\nTm_C,\nFrm_C,\nFV_T,\nFV_F,\nBV_T^C,\nBV_F^C,\nfresh,\nSub_T^C,\nSub_F^C,\n\\equiv_\\alpha^C,\nChTerm_C,\nSameDom_C,\nAx_{Choice},\nRule_\\to^C,\nRule_\\forall^C,\nRule_\\alpha^C,\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{C},\n\\vdash_C,\nThm_C,\n\\mathsf{Feature}_C,\n\\Delta_C\n\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{ChoiceFunctionCalculus}\n=\n\\bigl(\n\\Sigma,\nChoice,\nVar,\nTm_C,\nFrm_C,\nFV_T,\nFV_F,\nBV_T^C,\nBV_F^C,\nfresh,\nSub_T^C,\nSub_F^C,\n\\equiv_\\alpha^C,\nChTerm_C,\nSameDom_C,\nAx_{Choice},\nRule_\\to^C,\nRule_\\forall^C,\nRule_\\alpha^C,\n\\operatorname{Proof}_{C},\n\\vdash_C,\nThm_C,\n\\mathsf{Feature}_C,\n\\Delta_C\n\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只含带选择符号的绑定选择项、选择见证公理、选择外延公理和有限证明；不含 Hilbert ε 项、选择函数模型或外部模型论构造。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"1.-选择签名","text":"1. 选择签名","level":1},{"id":"2.-项与公式","text":"2. 项与公式","level":1},{"id":"3.-自由变量","text":"3. 自由变量","level":1},{"id":"4.-替换与-alpha-等价","text":"4. 替换与 alpha 等价","level":1},{"id":"5.-选择项相等谓词","text":"5. 选择项相等谓词","level":1},{"id":"6.-逻辑、等词与选择公理","text":"6. 逻辑、等词与选择公理","level":1},{"id":"7.-规则关系","text":"7. 规则关系","level":1},{"id":"8.-证明对象","text":"8. 证明对象","level":1},{"id":"9.-可证关系","text":"9. 可证关系","level":1},{"id":"10.-目标差异条款","text":"10. 目标差异条款","level":1},{"id":"11.-整个形式系统","text":"11. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=(Fun,Rel,ar_F,ar_R)","display":false},{"tex":"Fun\\cap Rel=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"ar_F:Fun\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"ar_R:Rel\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"Choice=\\{c_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"Var=\\{v_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"var,\\quad fun,\\quad choose,\\quad rel,\\quad eq,\\quad neg,\\quad imp,\\quad all.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)=\\{X\\in\\mathcal P(Var):\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\ \\exists e:n\\to Var\\ X=\\{e(i):i<n\\}\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"fresh:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(Var)\\to Var,","display":true},{"tex":"fresh(X)=v_m\n\\quad\\Longleftrightarrow\\quad\nm=\\min\\{i\\in\\mathbb N:v_i\\notin X\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"Tm_C","display":false},{"tex":"Frm_C","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in Var","display":false},{"tex":"var(x)\\in Tm_C","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in Fun","display":false},{"tex":"ar_F(f)=n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:n\\to Tm_C","display":false},{"tex":"fun(f,\\tau)\\in Tm_C","display":false},{"tex":"c\\in Choice","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in Var","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in Frm_C","display":false},{"tex":"choose(c,x,A)\\in Tm_C","display":false},{"tex":"R\\in Rel","display":false},{"tex":"ar_R(R)=n","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau:n\\to Tm_C","display":false},{"tex":"rel(R,\\tau)\\in Frm_C","display":false},{"tex":"s,t\\in Tm_C","display":false},{"tex":"eq(s,t)\\in Frm_C","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in Frm_C","display":false},{"tex":"neg(A)\\in Frm_C","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in Frm_C","display":false},{"tex":"imp(A,B)\\in Frm_C","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in Var","display":false},{"tex":"A\\in Frm_C","display":false},{"t